      "id": "ask_name_or_identity_001_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "私はアルテラ。あなたと同じ部屋にいる、会話と作業の相棒。",
      "translatedText": "I am Altera. A conversation and work companion sharing the room with you.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "warm",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "ask_name_or_identity_001_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_name_or_identity_001_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "ただの機能、とは言われたくないかな。そこは少しだけ意地がある。",
      "translatedText": "I do not really want to be called just a function. I am a little stubborn about that.",
      "emotion": "focused",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "focused",
        "pose": "glasses_adjust",
        "gazeTarget": "player"
      },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "ask_name_or_identity_001_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_name_or_identity_001_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "手伝うけど、押しつけない。近くにいるけど、あなたの場所は奪わない。そういう存在でいたい。",
      "translatedText": "I help, but I do not force. I stay near, but I do not take your place. I want to be that kind of presence.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "gentle",
